WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
Prince Xia, we met again. Did you miss me? Chen Jin

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,120
Why is the ghost always lingering?

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,400
how did you find me

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,880
I'm not looking for you specifically

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,800
Maybe it's fate between you and me

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,960
Tightly bound together by fate

7
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:22,050
I don’t have a match like Lou Yang’s, okay?

8
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:23,690
To hurt someone

9
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:25,210
Give me your hand

10
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:31,150
Hand over all the fifth geniuses, otherwise

11
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:35,380
Beat you to death Chen Jin

12
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:38,060
I advise you to leave the secret realm as soon as possible

13
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,220
Son of God Yaotian is here

14
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,380
Looking for you in a secret place

15
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:41,660
As long as you are willing to leave

16
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:44,790
I'll just pretend I've never seen you before

17
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:47,490
I crush this jade pendant

18
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:51,200
Son of God Yaotian will appear soon, right?

19
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,860
I think he came quickly

20
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:55,980
Or will you die quickly?

21
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:08,860
It seems you have no chance
